{"unit_id":"HeathHe__dsh-worktree-panel#card-zh","repo":"HeathHe/dsh-worktree-panel","commit":"adf481e99e0298787360bf58324bc6623b8892c4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-worktree-panel**（DSH Web 插件）：为 Git 项目增加 worktree 分支管理面板。它替换官方工作区侧栏组件，在项目下分层展示主工作树、分支 worktree 和会话，并通过 DSH 工作区注册表关联会话。主要功能包括查看分支与改动状态、为现有或新分支创建 worktree、删除 worktree、切换主分支，以及配置 worktree 存放位置和迁移目录。适合需要并行处理多个代码分支并在 DSH Web 中按工作树组织会话的开发者。需要本机 Git；不需要额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-9","lib/index.js:381-500","lib/index.js:540-625","lib/index.js:970-1080"]}
{"unit_id":"HeathHe__dsh-worktree-panel#card-en","repo":"HeathHe/dsh-worktree-panel","commit":"adf481e99e0298787360bf58324bc6623b8892c4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"**dsh-worktree-panel** (DSH Web plugin) adds Git worktree management to the workspace sidebar. It groups projects, branches, worktrees, and sessions; users can create or remove worktrees and switch branches. Storage is configurable. Local Git is required; no API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-9","lib/index.js:381-500","lib/index.js:540-625","lib/index.js:970-1080"]}
